{"server":"cn","storyId":"act15side_level_act15side_09_beg","groupId":"act15side","stageId":"act15side_09","title":"岁相","storyCode":"IW-9","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act15side/level_act15side_09_beg.txt","sourceHash":"c2924c982f446b850fc97e0fecac80a2e4d297ea6971003c0812cb2f7ffaabb4","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"07下"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g02_yanalley_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......年轻人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街头青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请问尚蜀知府梁大人的梁府，怎么走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街头青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊......就在这附近来着，前面右转走到底，看到个牌坊，左转就是梁府。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宽敞吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街头青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁知道，我又进不去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街头青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过从外面看上去......好像和其他地方没啥区别，反而显得有点寒酸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"牌坊上写的什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街头青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁记得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......谢谢了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街头青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，老头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街头青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天都要黑了，要不要我带个路啊？怕你路上出车祸哎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不必了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看得见路。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g06_mountainroad_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——呃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（脚......陷进石块里了！？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到此为止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三十三招，了不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你压根没动真格的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你若是有意投身军伍，必然大有可为。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......我离开勾吴城的时候确实想过这样做，不过俗话说得好，饭要一口口吃，我还是得先还了罗德岛的恩情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......知恩图报，难得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜你如今寸步难行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这倒是字面意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（把腿打折有机会拉出来吗......试试看吧......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"郑清钺，我来助阵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别想走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我把这场乱斗视作闹剧，并未上心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你告诉我，是我错了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你的话变少了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以前的话，一向是很少的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"郑清钺只有在全力以赴的时候是不说话的。而郑清钺全力以赴的时候，是很少有对手能全身而退的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......说够了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自说自话罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......下雨了......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（竟然瞬间打断了尚冢在手里的兵器！？没人反应过来——他如何做到的？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——什么人！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......斗笠蓑衣，指雨为剑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好功夫。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......别打了。都别打了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安稳点不好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g04_yaninn"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才有高人在场。如果他们真铁了心把事情闹大，赢的会是他们，占理的也会是他们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g06_mountainroad_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是一开始就跟着那个龙门人的船夫......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......梁洵果然一开始就做了两手打算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"司岁台和礼部都被他骗了过去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......梁大人身在官场，身不由己，你不觉得，是司岁台这次行动太过武断吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"司岁台的武断，也不止这一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我儿因你们而死。别忘了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打打杀杀的，何必呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，这闲事你也要管，当自己多大的能耐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......我就说，一个人总是戴着斗笠，是很奇怪的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除非......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慎楼，此乃朝廷司岁台履行公务，你不该插手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是个路过的船夫，本着一片好心，劝大家不要在这里打打杀杀——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——也看看山顶是什么情况。梁大人刻意托付过我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前些年大炎边境，水路闹水匪，朝廷果断派人出面解决，有如雷霆之势。由一位天师领头，几位朝廷高手，深入敌腹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为了避免惊动敌人，英雄好汉们乔装成了水匪，潜入他们的老巢，一网打尽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——只不过出来的时候，与另一伙见义勇为的船民迎面撞见，闹了些误会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实也根本没有什么一伙船民，分明就是一叶扁舟，独自靠近那座依水而建的匪巢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别说了，别说了，丢死个人......老大不小年纪了，也没多想，如莽夫一般就和人家打了起来，唉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"百姓只知道是天师牵头，却不知其余几人，才是真正定音之人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"禁军小教头对你评价颇高。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，那女娃年纪轻轻，功夫了得，听说已经开始辅佐对同期战友的训练，大有前途，大有前途......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但今天我也不是来叙旧的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如我镖局中人，对慎师傅这样的人，只有敬重。哪怕是初次见面，我也会听慎师傅的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是今天，公账私仇一并算，恐怕不是听慎师傅一句话......这么简单。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可答应了梁大人，我也是要有所表示的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事后无论肃政院如何定夺，我自会承担起责任，只是此时此刻，莫要因为一时武断，伤了和气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就是说不通了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......梁洵既然请动了你，就绝不只是来看一眼这么简单。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想干涉司岁台事务？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......司岁台无非想逼白天师动手罢了，那我来动这个手，难道有什么不一样吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......慎师傅，我站您这边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和气生财嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你那个恩人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先走一步了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如此也好——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g08_pavilion"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什......什么？那处山头和凉亭......是怎么出现的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这就是......我们一直在找的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但愿事态能控制住......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......不然就只能动粗了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g08_pavilion"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你知道自己在说什么吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要你们的帮助，年轻的秉烛人。利害关系上，咱们应该是一致的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要杀死自己？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还没那么病态，只是......情况紧急。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它的意思不就是你们的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该向那个伟大的自己揭竿而起了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......都是妄言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有什么办法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你愿意相信我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只负责听你说完你全部的想法。信不信，由司岁台定夺。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g09_teahouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......梁大人雅兴，这个时候了，还在山间赏雪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"坐吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道我要来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你当然要来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"司岁台何时找上的你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一年前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找酒盏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是找？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当时只是找。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g08_pavilion"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一年前，大炎意识到了一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维多利亚事变。乌萨斯动荡不断。莱塔尼亚的一位女皇失去声音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天下将乱，大炎必须做好准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"朝廷经连日大会，决议“二十八策”。无所不涉，不止求大炎一国安宁，更要大地处处留得生机。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是在公开的二十八策之外，仍有隐策两则，亟需大炎定夺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嚯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪两策？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g09_teahouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"北有异域邪祟，南接海域，更有岁兽隐患。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......司岁台始终主张优先解决巨兽问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"礼部不这么想，不完全这么想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尚书大人说的没错，那十二人中不仅有可用之才......特别是，有丰功硕德之人不在少数。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但司岁台设立之初，便旨在解决巨兽难题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凡事不能总听他们的。司岁台设立之初，还只是礼部下属罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是那场因棋局而起的祸事，才拔高了司岁台的地位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......千年前留下的隐患，为祸至今，是该解决解决了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可决定权既不在司岁台，也不在礼部一家之言。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g08_pavilion"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......当朝太傅？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太傅见了那个大罪人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......原来如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来我确实睡糊涂了......那个糟老头子，原来是这样的人物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看他身板脆弱，也不像是会法术的样子，还当是哪里爱管闲事的老头子呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......太傅缝补天下事，查漏补缺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以为你会因为我调侃那个糟老头子而生气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生气？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你会因为一个顽童责备天要下雨而生气吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（这小子......真敢说哎......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我还是第一次见到年被这样呛住。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太傅给了司岁台一道密旨。哪怕明面上与礼部小有摩擦，也必须得做到的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哦。什么事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三件事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g09_teahouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"降温了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"山里降温，总是快一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这家茶馆取景实在不好，这样怎么能留得住游客？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......为何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看不见夕阳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁大人替司岁台做这么多，很辛苦吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是瞒宁小姐瞒得更辛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......三年前，我被派至尚蜀，替礼部监管疑似定居于此的令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你作为尚蜀知府，其实也比起寻常同僚，更多了几分实权。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一开始以为你是个死板的愣头青呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......让宁小姐见笑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......梁大人，这些年，你做了这么多，为了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁某人从未改变过心思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为家乡百姓谋福祉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不惜欺瞒礼部与司岁台？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什么比一方百姓的安危重要？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道礼部是有准备的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"春雷本是冬去春来的象征。梁某人不希望这一声春雷，使三山十七峰再少一峰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......梁大人确实是那个梁大人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是你到底还是不想见到我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又怎么不会呢？你的表现太明显了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"官阶有别，职务在身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可如果......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果宁小姐只是宁小姐，梁某人怎么会不高兴呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁大人原来也会......这般......坦诚。"},{"type":"narration","text":"梁洵举起茶杯。\n杯中本无茶，倒还是饮了许久。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g08_pavilion"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......三件事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第一，找回酒盏。不知为何，那人向太傅全盘托出了酒盏的来历与当下的大致方位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们就不怕上了套？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第二，确保两道隐策之外，还能找到更加稳妥的方案，将此事控制在最小事态。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......每次涉及天下百姓的事情，大炎都显得十分谨慎嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第三......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......无论是谁，当超过三位代理人齐聚一方时，递出太傅亲笔的手谕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......手谕？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，夕在哪里？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g06_mountainroad_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......我怎么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你是谁......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......把你忘了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，谁让你昏过去了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爹、爹呢！？尚冢呢！？还有那个大块头——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别找了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找不到的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_town"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"竟能转瞬间改天换地......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个突然出现的女人......究竟是什么来头？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_plankroad"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魉","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是吧，还来！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g06_mountainroad_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在......在画里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说了你也听不懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等、等等，你要去哪儿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"山顶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是忘水坪不就在——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——那座凉亭......是什么时候出现的......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自古而来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"器伥","speakerId":"avg_npc_306_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗷——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这些东西......模仿出这种东西，是在取笑我吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g08_pavilion"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还真是不饶人啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"职责所在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我有个疑问，只是疑问啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我不肯听你的，司岁台打算怎么做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过是重做一遍千年前就做过的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何况如今，我们强大，你们势单力薄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嚯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"司岁台的方针很简单，一劳永逸，永绝后患。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我才说，我们利害一致。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你只是在给自己谋退路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算我相信你，我又如何相信你能做到这件荒唐事呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你做不到，那你的存在会造成多少不必要的危害？司岁台是否有更“稳妥”的方式解决问题？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说服不了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......看来还是谈不拢啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么看？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......问我？那不如问问你想找的那位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......原来如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是他所谓的大考？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你才是什么都不知道的那一个，小子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是不想面壁思过三百年，就别拿那种眼神看我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夕、夕小姐，别生气呀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们知道这只酒盏的由来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"交出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你们拜托梁洵，梁洵拜托我。你们要盏，应当去问梁洵要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鲤先生明事理，应该知道其中轻重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁洵一定有他的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......若是宁辞秋给不出合理的解释，梁洵要为自己的独断专行付出代价。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别总这么咄咄逼人嘛，小家伙，司岁台这么想要这只......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"司岁台为什么这么想要这只盏？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多半是那个棋痴的伎俩吧，反正他闲着也——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——不对......他不是这种人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他真的还被关在京城吗......？发生了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"司岁台最近一次靠近那处寺庙时，在庙中发现了一具尸体。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是国手相孺，心力衰竭，呕血而死。棋盘空无一物，唯独天元有一枚黑子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不是说见他一面，都是禁忌吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"司岁台在查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可这只酒盏，无疑是揭穿他阴谋的重要线索之一。而二位，年小姐，夕小姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"司岁台想请你们走一趟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊哈哈，这下事情麻烦了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他难道比我们快一步？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何止一步？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难怪那个老头会这么咄咄逼人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么......令小姐呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"司岁台记载，他与余兽皆有不合，唯独愿与令黍二人吟诗作乐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果她还不现身，那司岁台只能——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你找我？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她看着日落。\n走过太古与其他的时间。\n其实，时间是个地方。\n唯有逍遥之人，才能驻足的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼......啊......看看这景色吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"日尽水长去......雪落月空留。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"落日烧云，多娇妩媚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如此良辰美景，你们却非要说这些败兴的话题吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......什么时候......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，你和你父亲年轻时候很像。不过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看这满天烧云，难道你视若无睹吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你没有活在这天下吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"过会儿再赞美你的夕阳吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我费了老大劲拖着夕来找你，可不是为了听你诗兴大发的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好久不见，年，夕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有这位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？你和老鲤认识？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在此之前......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g07_fairyland_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样下三滥的手段，是否稍微有些失了品格？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......瞒不过你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我也没想过，你能一眼识破。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以为你走的是谁的路？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我也没打算真能骗过你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再说了，是他做了个白日梦，梦见他是我罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这把戏难道不是，我和你学的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我醒仍是我，蝶梦还是蝶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可他一觉醒来，还能是他吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁知道呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这可由不得你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真不客气啊，令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是真有能耐，和大哥耍横去，欺负一个寻常人类做什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"道不同不相为谋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？那你我就是同道了？我怎么不知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"举杯尽欢历历在目，你倒是无情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也对，毕竟你还扔掉了......我送你的那只酒盏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......怎么会呢，只是对月当歌，一不留神罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"失望的是我才是。原来那时起，你就早早地......落下一子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你笑什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我笑年不自量力。我笑夕胆怯无能。我笑你置身事外。也笑我自己，还是这般自以为是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真想取而代之？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g08_pavilion"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？我怎么了？干嘛看着我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，只是看穿了一个无聊的把戏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们找我做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就不能是单纯想来探望一下令姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你睡着了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我问，你睡着了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你为什么能——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......醉了就睡了嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么做到的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你问我怎么做到的......啊，我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你睡不着了吗，可怜的妹妹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为怕做噩梦吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果那还能叫噩梦的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯......我们有很多年没见了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来你在为这种事情苦恼，你的画呢？难道你的画承载不了你的梦吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......是你终于开始觉得，画，都是假的了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cottage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！喂，别乱动我的画！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"山头下面那些普通人也被你收进这方天地中了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么嘛......拙山枯水，心如死灰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魉","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过这些可爱的小涂鸦，倒还是那么有趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"需要喂它们什么吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你应该知道我们是来做什么的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"依你的想法，我们最后会何去何从？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们别这么盯着我啊，我这不是在想嘛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不过，现在还不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道啊......嗯......不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不算最好的答案。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g08_pavilion"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夕，刚才那幅画尽是死物，故步自封，差点意思，别留了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......轮不到你来指手画脚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别忘了当初，给你们每个人取下一字真名的她，对你们抱有怎样的期待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......老黄历了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们刚才......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么，只是偷得片刻浮生，离这世间而去罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太傅有东西要你转交给我，对吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这不是同一件事。你们看过了手谕，还是要乖乖跟司岁台走一趟的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为了找他。找那个......臭棋篓子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔？一封信？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你所谓的太傅手谕......不对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个字迹......那个人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太傅是个不苟言笑的人，他绝不会用这样的草书拟什么手谕......他没有交代你什么吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只负责把信送到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"朝廷的信啊......久违的事情了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"写给我们的？人类何时都能有这份胆魄了？我还当只有真龙和他身边的少数人够胆呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你来看看内容吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g07_fairyland_2"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g08_pavilion"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g07_fairyland_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......事不过三啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来如此，确实可以说是“事不过三”了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"字字成谶......？这绝不可能是那个老头太傅写的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这字迹看起来像是颉，可她已经......难道是另有人仿写？可为什么是太傅的“手谕”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是那个臭棋篓子。看来这些年，他“学”到了不少东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本以为他一意孤行，应该招来大炎怒火才是......结果这一封手谕，也是他的一步棋？太傅又何必替他送信......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除非......太傅执白？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！别嘟囔了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"三人无言。\n即使是存在了漫长时间的她们，也一时无言。\n风自亘古来，此时已非此刻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那、那是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不可能......他连这种事情都能做到吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别问我啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只不过......哪怕只是个影子......我也不喜欢这么被它盯着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夕啊，你怕了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你不是点子挺多吗？想想办法啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，令姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们得一起——你在做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我突然想起来，上次酩酊大醉前，在这放了两壶酒水才是......有了有了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......湖松酒？嗯......味道闻着还不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你倒是镇静，有没有办法！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"办法？什么办法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对付它的办法——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——对付自己的办法，需要我告诉你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你这次，该不会也打算袖手旁观？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们又见面了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这一次，是我梦见了你，还是你梦见了我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“岁相”","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"令用尾巴卷起半坛美酒，倒入那仿佛是罪魁祸首的酒盏。\n对天举起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喝酒吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"免了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"还请其余几位，一一入座。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！发生了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里是哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个感觉，就像在夕小姐的画中一样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么......你是谁？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑夜如幕。\n一个人影，端坐室中。\n他的身后，挂着半幅字画。\n《天圆地方》。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"几位若是无事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来陪我手谈一局？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
